 ],
 "briefing": "Halvard Depot is a weather station high in the Ostfjell range, cut off by snow since October. Its new owners are not studying the weather: they are testing a guidance unit for long-range drones, and the prototype console sits in the depot lab.\n\nThe lab is sealed with a red keycard kept in the security office. Get the card, destroy the console, and get out through the vehicle tunnel: it leaves the garage through the north wall (yellow stripes on the floor) and runs east to daylight.\n\nThe front door is quickest and best guarded. A maintenance duct runs up the west side of the building into the generator room — dark, tight, and quiet.",
 "loadout": [
  "pistol_sd",
  "pistol"
 ]
